# Audit data isolation

- Default model mode is `heuristic` (no network). Allowed model hosts are only `localhost`, `127.0.0.1`, and `*.azure.com`.
- Reject public LLM, OCR, embedding, and tracing hosts (OpenAI public API, Gemini, Groq, Hugging Face Inference, LangSmith).
- Do not add LangChain. Do not set tracing environment variables.
- Do not write source audit files to Fabric or any shared lakehouse.
- Never put one engagement's document text into another engagement's prompt.
- Explanation calls may send finding JSON only, after Python has computed the numbers.
- Log metadata hashes, not document bodies, passwords, or tokens.
